{"The align-items mixin contains a non-standard property -ms-align-items (IE10 uses -ms-flex-align)": 0.36160755157470703, "The order mixin uses legacy properties (-webkit-box-ordinal-group and -moz-box-ordinal-group) that are 1-based while the modern order property is 0-based - the value passed to legacy properties should be $val + 1": 0.7151676416397095, "The align-items mixin has inconsistent indentation (4 spaces instead of 2)": 0.02515723556280136, "Missing space in the standard align-items property": 0.023623565211892128, "Trailing whitespace on line 120": 0.025179391726851463, "Legacy properties like -webkit-box-align and -ms-flex-align use different value keywords (e.g., start/end instead of flex-start/flex-end)": 0.34361979365348816, "Legacy order properties do not support negative values": 0.07736635953187943, "Using a percentage (1.5%) for the gutter between avatar and text is problematic as it scales with container width, leading to insufficient spacing on mobile devices - a fixed unit like px or em is preferred": 0.2512208819389343, "The vertical padding (0.5em) from the previous implementation has been removed, which might negatively impact the vertical spacing of elements": 0.20176997780799866}